  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">A test fails on origin/master: a Signal reviewed twice yields two rows on the decided set, each with its own record.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">A gate Decision Record the caller can read is listed with its summary and no Open action (server field and client test).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Must-not-fire: a record not created by the writer (WriterCreatedRecord) is omitted; a secure-child record of a family the caller is not in is omitted; a no-core record owned by someone else is omitted; existing decided-set tests pass or a changed assertion is justified.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Build, Signals filter (contract baselines updated), full ArchTests, client-lint and the Worklist jest suite pass; publish-size delta reported.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>
