  <completion>Done 2026-11-27: PR #3277 squash-merged to master (17be3da07a; Closes #2015) after two independent Opus adversarial reviews and two fix rounds. The Decision Records tab reads Decision Records first: Signal-backed records under their Signal, email-gate records under their matter with no Open action (D-231), through two bounded caller-trimmed reads (the capped-read 503 risk was removed by splitting the reads). Known limit filed: DI-180 #3283 (Procedure, billing and assign-firm records with no Signal are not listed; owner decision). On dev with the uac-r2 dev BFF deploy of 5cd40984b0 (2026-11-27, master 765a199922).</completion>
